<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>The Unignorable Portfolio Framework</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-deep: #090d10;
            --bg-panel: #12181d;
            --primary-green: #15803d;
            --volt-lime: #ccff00;
            --volt-hover: #b5e600;
            --text-bright: #f1f5f9;
            --text-dim: #64748b;
            --border-glow: #1e293b;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-deep);
            color: var(--text-bright);
            padding: 3rem 1rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .wrapper {
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        header {
            margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
            border-left: 4px solid var(--volt-lime);
            padding-left: 1.5rem;
        }

        header h1 {
            font-size: 2.8rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: -0.03em;
            line-height: 1.1;
        }

        header h1 span {
            color: var(--volt-lime);
        }

        header p {
            color: var(--text-dim);
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            margin-top: 0.5rem;
            max-width: 700px;
        }

        /* Interactive Tabs */
        .tab-navigation {
            display: flex;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border-glow);
            margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
            overflow-x: auto;
        }

        .tab-btn {
            background: none;
            border: none;
            color: var(--text-dim);
            padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
            font-size: 1rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
            white-space: nowrap;
            border-bottom: 3px solid transparent;
            margin-bottom: -2px;
        }

        .tab-btn:hover {
            color: var(--text-bright);
        }

        .tab-btn.active {
            color: var(--volt-lime);
            border-bottom-color: var(--volt-lime);
        }

        .tab-content {
            display: none;
            animation: fadeIn 0.3s ease-in-out forwards;
        }

        .tab-content.active {
            display: block;
        }

        /* Framework Typography & Layout Components */
        .grid-two {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
            gap: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        .card {
            background-color: var(--bg-panel);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-glow);
            padding: 2rem;
            border-radius: 12px;
            position: relative;
        }

        .card-accent {
            border-top: 3px solid var(--primary-green);
        }

        .card h3 {
            color: var(--volt-lime);
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
        }

        .pill {
            background: rgba(204, 255, 0, 0.1);
            color: var(--volt-lime);
            padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-weight: 700;
            border-radius: 4px;
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
        }

        ol, ul {
            padding-left: 1.25rem;
            color: #cbd5e1;
        }

        li {
            margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
        }

        strong {
            color: var(--text-bright);
        }

        /* Sweat Equity Framework Component */
        .sweat-equity-matrix {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 1rem;
            background: linear-gradient(145deg, #111827, #030712);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-glow);
            padding: 2.5rem;
            border-radius: 16px;
            margin-top: 1rem;
        }

        .matrix-row {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 180px 1fr;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            padding-bottom: 1.5rem;
            padding-top: 0.5rem;
        }

        .matrix-row:last-child {
            border-bottom: none;
            padding-bottom: 0;
        }

        .matrix-label {
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: var(--primary-green);
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
        }

        /* Code/Template block layout */
        .template-block {
            background: #000;
            border: 1px dashed var(--primary-green);
            padding: 1.5rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;
            color: #a7f3d0;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            white-space: pre-line;
            margin: 1.5rem 0;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        @keyframes fadeIn {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(8px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .matrix-row {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                gap: 0.5rem;
            }
            header h1 { font-size: 2rem; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="wrapper">
    <header>
        <h1>The Unignorable <span>Portfolio Engine</span></h1>
    </header>

    <!-- Navigation Hub -->
    <nav class="tab-navigation">
        <button class="tab-btn active" onclick="switchTab(event, 'grit')">1. Documenting Daily Grit</button>
        <button class="tab-btn" onclick="switchTab(event, 'framework')">2. Sweat Equity Framework</button>
        <button class="tab-btn" onclick="switchTab(event, 'templates')">3. Case Study Templates</button>
    </nav>

    <!-- Tab 1: Daily Grit -->
    <div id="grit" class="tab-content active">
        <div class="grid-two">
            <div class="card card-accent">
                <h3><span>01</span> GitHub-Style Transparency</h3>
                <p style="color: var(--text-dim); margin-bottom: 1rem;">Don't wait for final delivery to showcase your project. Document the dirty work.</p>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>The Public Commits:</strong> Log your daily baseline. Whether it's a line of code, a weld bead, or data cleanup, update a public repository or micro-site daily.</li>
                    <li><strong>The Failed Path Logs:</strong> Note down the bugs, bad hypotheses, and broken models. Showing <em>how</em> you troubleshoot highlights high situational awareness.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="card card-accent">
                <h3><span>02</span> Time-Lapse Technical Evidence</h3>
                <p style="color: var(--text-dim); margin-bottom: 1rem;">Humanize your workflow to force viewers past a simple glance.</p>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Screen-Capture Sprints:</strong> Record hyper-lapse clips of your technical deep-work blocks. Drop them seamlessly into project intros.</li>
                    <li><strong>Vulnerability Metrics:</strong> "Spent 6 hours optimizing a query that ended up yielding only a 2% increase. Here's exactly why my architecture choice limited it."</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Tab 2: Sweat Equity -->
    <div id="framework" class="tab-content">
        <div class="sweat-equity-matrix">
            <h2 style="color: var(--text-bright); font-size: 1.6rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">The Structural Proof System</h2>
            <p style="color: var(--text-dim); margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Turn invisible intellectual labor into undeniable tangible data by proving your environment, habits, and production metrics.</p>
            
            <div class="matrix-row">
                <div class="matrix-label">1. Environment</div>
                <div>
                    <span class="pill">Structure</span>
                    <p style="margin-top: 0.5rem; color: #e2e8f0;"><strong>What is your sandbox constraint?</strong> Clearly specify your strict operating parameters. E.g., "Built completely within AWS free tier limits," or "Using exclusively scrap Grade-2 carbon steel under a $50 overall budget constraint."</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="matrix-row">
                <div class="matrix-label">2. Behavior</div>
                <div>
                    <span class="pill">Execution</span>
                    <p style="margin-top: 0.5rem; color: #e2e8f0;"><strong>What was the systemic friction?</strong> Highlight the routine habits required to execute. Show raw logs tracking your strict velocity. E.g., "3 hours of active diagnostic testing every morning at 5:00 AM across 45 consecutive calendar days."</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="matrix-row">
                <div class="matrix-label">3. Output</div>
                <div>
                    <span class="pill">Collateral</span>
                    <p style="margin-top: 0.5rem; color: #e2e8f0;"><strong>What is the standalone output?</strong> Deliver an easily verifiable, unignorable artifact. E.g., a fully operational deployment link, an open-source tool, or an industry-certified engineering drawing pack ready to print.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Tab 3: Case Study Templates -->
    <div id="templates" class="tab-content">
        <div class="card">
            <h3>Raw Study Notes ➔ Professional Case Study Framework</h3>
            <p style="color: var(--text-dim);">Copy, paste, and fill this markdown boilerplate out for your individual projects to quickly structure them for review.</p>
            
            <div class="template-block">
# Project Title: [System Name or Problem Statement]
## Executive Summary
* **The High-Stakes Challenge:** [Describe the problem in 2 clear sentences]
* **The Final Concrete Output:** [What structural asset did you deliver?]
* **The Core ROI Metric:** [E.g., Reduced build time by 40%, achieved 98% accuracy]

## 1. The Friction & Environmental Constraints
* [Detail what rules or budget ceilings you operated under]
* [List your tooling stack or materials used]

## 2. Daily Grit Logs (The Iteration Cycle)
* **Hypothesis Alpha:** [What did you try first?]
* **The Critical Failure Point:** [Why and how did it fail under stress testing?]
* **The Pivot:** [How did raw behavioral data redirect your project?]

## 3. Standard Verification & Output Proof
* [Embed code repository link, CAD schema, or video blueprint]
* [Link to validation testing metrics or production runs]
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<script>
    function switchTab(event, tabId) {
        // Hide all tabs
        const contents = document.querySelectorAll('.tab-content');
        contents.forEach(content => content.classList.remove('active'));

        // Deactivate all buttons
        const buttons = document.querySelectorAll('.tab-btn');
        buttons.forEach(btn => btn.classList.remove('active'));

        // Activate selected tab and button
        document.getElementById(tabId).classList.add('active');
        event.currentTarget.classList.add('active');
    }
</script>

</body>
</html>
